# Build context for the `backend` service is the repository root (it needs both
# backend/ and frontend/). Without this file the whole tree — .git, the AI
# services and their .env files, node_modules — is uploaded to the Docker
# daemon on every build.
#
# Nothing here is copied into the image today; the exclusions keep the context
# small and make an accidental `COPY . .` in future far less dangerous.
.git/
.gitignore
*.md
docs/
infra/

# The AI services have their own build contexts and Dockerfiles.
AI-Services/

# Secrets, never in any context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/coverage.xml
**/.coverage
.DS_Store
